WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.080
- I don't think I've
ever had Israeli food,

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.413
but I also don't know
what food I have had.

00:00:12.842 --> 00:00:14.642
So, you pronounce it "peter's guitar"?

00:00:14.642 --> 00:00:16.929
- [Man in Stripes] Peter's
guitar, I love peter's guitar.

00:00:16.929 --> 00:00:19.146
- Look at how good these look!

00:00:19.146 --> 00:00:21.515
- They love the sesame seeds!

00:00:21.515 --> 00:00:22.978
- Kinda looks like a quiche-y pizza.

00:00:24.439 --> 00:00:25.729
- Mm-kay, that was a work out.

00:00:25.729 --> 00:00:27.029
- It's really good, except they forgot

00:00:27.029 --> 00:00:29.189
the sauce, the cheese, and the pepperoni.

00:00:29.189 --> 00:00:30.550
- It's pretty dry.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.611
- Does it come with any dipping sauces?

00:00:32.611 --> 00:00:33.867
- It tastes like dust.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.279
- Israeli Cheeto dust.

00:00:35.279 --> 00:00:36.863
- Yeah, it should be more like pizza.

00:00:36.863 --> 00:00:37.795
- [Man in White Shirt] Whoa, what?

00:00:37.795 --> 00:00:38.555
- [Man in Stripes] Look at this!

00:00:38.555 --> 00:00:39.729
Look how cool it is!

00:00:39.729 --> 00:00:40.868
It's a croissant.

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:41.948
- With sesame seeds.

00:00:41.948 --> 00:00:43.748
- They over-invested in
sesame seeds one year,

00:00:43.748 --> 00:00:45.292
and they're like, "We're just
gonna use it on everything."

00:00:45.292 --> 00:00:47.126
- This is our main export, sesame seed.

00:00:47.126 --> 00:00:52.070
- Let's "sesame see"
how well they stay on.

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.129
- I'm gonna leave.

00:00:53.129 --> 00:00:54.873
- Oh, it's flaky, I appreciate that.

00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:56.640
- You like flaky things?

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.935
- Rule number one to making Israeli food,

00:00:58.935 --> 00:01:01.854
it has to crumble everywhere.

00:01:01.854 --> 00:01:02.972
- Is there something in it?

00:01:02.972 --> 00:01:04.179
- A big block of cheese in the middle.

00:01:04.179 --> 00:01:06.225
- (gasps) Oh, that's where the magic is!

00:01:06.225 --> 00:01:08.962
- Oh my god, breakfast,
lunch, and dinner, please!

00:01:08.962 --> 00:01:10.985
- I would love to dip it
in some marinara sauce.

00:01:10.985 --> 00:01:12.343
- Do I have food all over my face?

00:01:12.343 --> 00:01:12.931
- No.

00:01:12.931 --> 00:01:13.469
- Cool.

00:01:13.469 --> 00:01:14.692
- [Man in White Shirt] Sabikh!

00:01:14.692 --> 00:01:15.778
Like a bird beak.
- [Man in Stripes] So finally,

00:01:15.778 --> 00:01:17.504
it's got a lot of things going on.

00:01:17.504 --> 00:01:19.274
- Now this looks scary.

00:01:19.274 --> 00:01:21.315
- It's not the nicest looking thing.

00:01:21.315 --> 00:01:23.379
- It's like a sandwich that
you left in your lunch bag

00:01:23.379 --> 00:01:24.754
and then sat on it, or something.

00:01:24.754 --> 00:01:26.134
- Do we use our hands?

00:01:26.134 --> 00:01:28.133
- Whole medley of stuff in here.

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:31.243
- Yeah, it is just burstin'
at the seams with gooey stuff.

00:01:31.243 --> 00:01:33.292
- This is basically like a
five-course meal within a pita.

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:34.460
(girl laughs)

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.004
- That's a lot of meals.

00:01:36.004 --> 00:01:38.094
- One culinary journey
I do not want to go on.

00:01:38.094 --> 00:01:41.234
- It's like a Hot Pocket, but good.

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:42.680
- For me, this is a winner.

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:43.678
- Go Isreal.

00:01:43.678 --> 00:01:45.801
- [Man in White Shirt and
Man in Stripes] Shakshouka!

00:01:45.801 --> 00:01:47.574
- [Man in Stripes] The famous Marvel hero.

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:49.399
- This looks Italian.

00:01:49.399 --> 00:01:50.688
- That's just because it's red.

00:01:50.688 --> 00:01:53.138
- I can't say I'm a fan
of the presentation.

00:01:53.138 --> 00:01:53.945
- Ehh...

00:01:53.945 --> 00:01:55.654
- Look at this thingy!

00:01:55.654 --> 00:01:56.861
- We won't need these spoons.

00:01:56.861 --> 00:01:58.105
- Oh, no!

00:01:58.105 --> 00:01:59.241
- The texture is weird.

00:01:59.241 --> 00:02:01.541
- This looks like an eyeball!

00:02:01.541 --> 00:02:02.457
- I see eggs.

00:02:02.457 --> 00:02:03.142
- Ooh, ooh!

00:02:03.142 --> 00:02:04.049
- I love it.
- It's spicy.

00:02:04.049 --> 00:02:05.235
- You know what?

00:02:05.235 --> 00:02:07.462
Tastes exactly what it looks like.

00:02:07.462 --> 00:02:08.796
- Did you wash your hands before this?

00:02:08.796 --> 00:02:09.586
- No.

00:02:09.586 --> 00:02:11.083
- "Israeli" good!
(girl laughs)

00:02:11.083 --> 00:02:13.835
- [Together] ♫ More food, more
food, more Israeli, Israeli,

00:02:13.835 --> 00:02:16.712
- ♫ Food, food, more
food, more food, Israeli

00:02:16.712 --> 00:02:18.112
♫ food food, more food

00:02:18.112 --> 00:02:19.456
♫ I want more Israeli food

00:02:19.456 --> 00:02:21.426
♫ Give some more, more food, yeah ♫

